title: Merchant_Meet
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>>
<<wait 1>>
<<picture YarnCommands merchant>>
<<fade_in YarnCommands 1>>
Merchant: "Kihihi... Welcome, young lady."
Merchant: "Here to buy somethin'? I got wares that might interest you."
<<open_shop_panel MerchantYarnCommands>>
===

title: merchant_heal
---
<<if is_full_health()>>
	<<jump merchant_health_full>>
<<elseif gold() >= 200>>
	<<change_gold -200>>
	<<change_health_percent 50>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "There. You look less dead already."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_vigor
---
<<if gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_vigor 25>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "A little more fortitude for that fragile frame."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_metabolism
---
<<if gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_metabolism 1>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "Such a lively body! Better keep that stomach full."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_light
---
<<if light() >= 100>>
	<<jump merchant_light_full>>
<<elseif gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_light 10>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "Here's something to brigthen the flames, stay safe young lady..."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_broke
---
<<merchant_purchase_broke>>
Merchant: "Sorry, young lady, but I don't do charity. Best come back when you're a lil' richer. Kihihi..."
===

title: merchant_light_full
---
<<merchant_purchase_broke>>
Merchant: "Your lantern is already as bright as it gets, young lady. Unless you're feeling generous enough to make a little donation? Kihihi..."
===

title: merchant_health_full
---
<<merchant_purchase_broke>>
Merchant: "You're already the very picture of health. Don't waste your Gold, young lady."
===

title: merchant_proficiency
---
<<if gold() >= 250>>
	<<change_gold -250>>
	<<change_proficiency 1>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "Here are some books you can read and learn from. Been tryin' to get rid of 'em, they're too heavy, y'know?"
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_insight
---
<<if gold() >= 150>>
	<<change_gold -150>>
	<<change_insight 1>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "Open your eyes, and the world shall reveal more of itself."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_affinity
---
<<if gold() >= 200>>
	<<change_gold -200>>
	<<change_affinity 2>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "You'll get a little more mileage out of those fancy tricks now."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_capacity
---
<<if gold() >= 100>>
	<<change_gold -100>>
	<<change_capacity 2>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "A little more room for what the journey demands."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_card_removal
---
<<if not has_removable_card()>>
	Merchant: "Your belongings are already too thin. Come back with something worth removing."
<<elseif gold() >= 300>>
	<<open_card_removal MerchantYarnCommands>>
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_card_removal_complete
---
<<merchant_purchase_success>>
Merchant: "One less burden for the road."
===

title: merchant_card_procurement
---
<<if gold() >= 200>>
	<<open_default_card_procurement MerchantYarnCommands>>
    <<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "A useful addition to your collection, eh? ...No? Shit."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_premium_procurement
---
	<<if not has_premium_procurement()>>
	Merchant: "That particular stock has not arrived yet."
	<<elseif gold() >= 600>>
	<<open_premium_card_procurement MerchantYarnCommands>>
    <<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "Now THESE are some fine selections! I guarantee you won't be disappointed. Kihihi..."
	<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
	<<endif>>
===

title: merchant_bye_bye
---
<<close_shop_panel MerchantYarnCommands>>
Merchant: "Try not to die out there. Kihihi... "
<<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>>
<<wait 1>>
<<fade_out YarnCommands 2>>
<<load_map_scene>>
===

title: merchant_potency
---
<<if gold() >= 300>>
	<<change_gold -300>>
	<<change_potency 1>>
	<<merchant_purchase_success>>
	Merchant: "A little more ‘sting’ for that edge of yours. They're gonna feel that, alright."
<<else>>
	<<jump merchant_broke>>
<<endif>>
===

